tinct characters will appear. The sheer variety of racial civilizations will bring a visual feast and incredible experience to all players.<br><br></li><li><strong> Oculus Support</strong> - Currently the game does NOT support Oculus. However we are working on this and WE WILL support Oculus very soon!</li></ul>",
