                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Who would have imagined that most VR games almost 8 years later would look worse than this game? This is a good looking game, looks better than most PCVR games released in recent times. It may be worth buying just to see what could have been. Unfortunately, it's basically a demo being sold for .99 cents. Worse than that, these devs made this a longer game, but sold it separately with a slightly different title and then changed the title for this game to include the word demo. \n\nI might still recommend a game like this if it had more content. However, the whole thing takes about 12 minutes. Also, the combat is too basic. Weapon feels out-dated. Teleport only. No turning at all. \n\nIt's a close call, but 99 cents for such a short demo which looks great, but plays poorly is a no from me.\n\n[b]Rate 4.5/10. [/b] It DOES work on the Meta Quest 3 using link cable.",
